OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price's ex says sex
OL,4,Aaddiction was made up
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price's ex Kieran Hayler has told
OL,7,Fa jury he falsely described himself as
OL,8,Fa sex addict as part of a publicity
OL,9,Fstrategy after an affair while married
OL,10,Fto the media personality became public.
OL,12,FThe 39-year-old is on trial at Lewes
OL,13,FCrown Court accused of three counts of
OL,14,Frape and one count of sexual assault
OL,15,Fagainst a 13-year-old girl in West
OL,16,FSussex in 2016.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
