OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price's ex says sex
OL,4,Aaddiction was made up
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring cross-examination on Friday,
OL,7,Fprosecutor Ryan Richter suggested
OL,8,FHayler was "practised at having
OL,9,Faffairs" and referred to previous
OL,10,Finterviews in which he described
OL,11,Fhimself as having a sex addiction.
OL,13,FHayler replied: "I have used that
OL,14,Fdescription, yes, but it's not
OL,15,Fcorrect."
